    <!--
      The English row on a received bubble: its two settings. "English" here is the hardcoded code
      en and never the app language - the summaries say "the English" rather than naming a language so
      they cannot drift into meaning "the app language".
      The second switch only means anything while the first is on, and the screen greys it and says so
